    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Nurses and midwives across the country are set to benefit from months of collective effort amongst stakeholders in the profession, after the launch of the inaugural National Nursing and Midwifery Policy and other regulatory tools. This comes at a time when the profession is facing numerous challenges such as downing of tools and 'brain drain' with professional nurses and midwives opting to relocate and work abroad.",
